      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Refshale%C3%B8en%2C_Copenhagen"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "After the shipyard closed in 1996, the abandoned buildings became a mix of creative studios, flea markets, and storage.",
