      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Refshale%C3%B8en%2C_Copenhagen"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Since 2018, the island hosts Reffen, Northern Europe's largest street‑food market with 40 restaurants.",
